// Embeds the executable's icon. Generated from AppIcon.rc.in by
// CMakeLists.txt's configure_file() call - @ALTENGINE_ICON_PATH@ gets
// substituted with the actual icon path at configure time, so this
// works regardless of the resource compiler's current working
// directory (an absolute path baked in here, rather than a relative
// one that would depend on where rc.exe/windres happens to run from).
IDI_ICON1 ICON "@ALTENGINE_ICON_PATH@"
